  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qdr7tDW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2253\" height=\"772\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Cardiac 是一個輕巧的 Minecraft 模組，引入了全新的遊戲機制：擊敗怪物後會掉落生命球。玩家可以收集這些生命球來恢復生命值，為生存與戰鬥增添簡單的策略元素。此模組設計上力求與大多數 Minecraft 模組相容，並盡可能做到可自訂化。儘管如此，它仍然易於安裝，無需任何額外設定即可流暢整合到遊戲中。</p><h3><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/B3y6Cjf.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"889\" height=\"501\"></h3><h3>&nbsp;</h3><h2><strong>下載：</strong></h2><ul>\n<li>1.21.0：<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cardiac/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.21&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.20.1：<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cardiac/files/5091027\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge/NeoForge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.19.2：<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cardiac/files/5091030\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></strong></li>\n<li>1.18.2：<strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cardiac/files/all?page=1&amp;version=1.18.2&amp;gameVersionTypeId=1\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forge</a></strong></li>\n</ul><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/2hdfX6C.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gG6f4t0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/SSKirillSS/cardiac\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sK6KJcQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcardiac\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https: